    "Exchange/Visiting Pre-Arrival Guide - e. Getting to HUFS (Public Transportation)\nSearch this site\nEmbedded Files\nSkip to main content\nSkip to navigation\nGetting to HUFS\nPublic Transportation\nHow to get to HUFS\nSeoul Campus\nBy Train/Subway to Seoul STation\nExpress Train\nThere are two ways to get to Seoul Station. The “EXPRESS TRAIN” goes to\nSeoul Station\ndirectly and is non-stop, takes about 51 minutes.\nRegular Train\nThe “REGULAR TRAIN” has 12 stops before arriving at Seoul Station, takes about one hour.\nFrom Seoul Station\nTaxi\nFrom Seoul Station, you can take a taxi to Hankuk of Foreign Studies. You can tell the taxi driver “\n한국외국어대학교 가주세요\n” [Hankuk-way-gook-oh-dae-hak-yo ka-jusaeyo] which means please take me to HUFS.\nTransfer to subway line 1 (Dark Blue Line) and ride the train that is headed in the direction of Yeoncheon [\n연천\n].\nOnce you get on, make sure to get off at Hankuk of Foreign Studies station (\n외대앞\n).\nAirport Limousine Bus\nOnce you are out of the airport, you will want to exit out of the main exit doors. As you exit, you will see the platform for airport buses. You want to say, “ Can I get a ticket to Cheongnyangni station\n(청량리) (청량리 가는 티켓 사고 싶어요)\n” .\nThe ticket should look like this (MAKE SURE THE NUMBER IS\n6002\n)\nThe station that you are getting off will be the last one. From there, you can either take Line 1 subway or take a taxi  The taxi fee should be around KRW 7,000 and take about 10 minutes.\nIf you still are having trouble with the bus, please click on this link.\nhttps://airportlimousine.co.kr/en/\nAirport\nPick-up service\nYou can book an airport pickup through\nEnterance\n.\nHUFS Application Page:\nwww.enter-biz.com/hufs2\nMeeting Point:\nhttps://www.enter-biz.com/manual\nCome see us!\nBuilding #14\nPlease visit the Office of International Admissions & Management (\n국제입학관리팀\n) at Historical Building Room 101, when you arrive at HUFS.\nHow to get to HUFS\nGlobal Campus\nGlobal Campus\nTake\nCity-Airport\nBus\nno.\n5400 or 5400-1\nfrom Inchon International Airport.\n- Terminal 1 (T1) Bus gate :\n9A-2 (1F)\n- Teminal 2 (T2) Bus gate :\n39 (B1)\nto\nJeongja Station (\n정자역\n)\n** fare rate : around KRW 12,000 (Over 2  baggages will be charged KRW 8,000)\nTake a taxi to Global Campus\n. (Address :\n용인시 처인구 모현읍 외대로 81, 한국외국어대학교 기숙사\n)\nYou can tell the taxi driver \"\n한국외국어대학교 기숙사에 가 주세요\n\" (\"Please take me to Dorm of the HUFS\")\nor show them the name\n한국외국어대학교 기숙사\n(HUFS Dorm). It would take about 30 min.\n** fare rate : around KRW 25,000\nCome see us!\nBuilding #0\nPlease visit the Office of International Admissions & Management (\n국제입학관리팀\n) at Centennial Complex 2 floor Room 204, when you arrive at HUFS.\nSeoul Campus\nOffice of International Admissions & Management\nHankuk University of Foreign Studies\n107 Imun-ro, Dongdaemun-gu\nSeoul 02450, South Korea\nTel: +82-2-2173-2062\nFax: +82-2-2173-2877\nEmail:\nexchange@hufs.ac.kr\nHomepage:\nhttp://international.hufs.ac.kr\nStudent Guidebook:\nhttps://hellohufs.hufs.ac.kr\nFacebook:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/hufsinternationalexchange/\nTwitter: @studyinkorea\nGlobal Campus\nOffice of International Admissions & Management\nHankuk University of Foreign Studies\n81 Oaedae-ro, Mohyun-eup, Cheoin-gu, Yongin-si\nGyeonggi-do 17035, South Korea\nTel: +82-31-330-4734\nFax: +82-31-330-4736\nEmail: hufsinbound@hufs.ac.kr\nHomepage:\nhttp://international.hufs.ac.kr\nStudent Guidebook:\nhttps://hellohufs.hufs.ac.kr\nFacebook:\nhttps://www.facebook.com/hufsinternationalexchange/\nTwitter: @studyinkorea\nReport abuse\nPage details\nPage updated\nReport abuse"
